[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~lGurdians of the Frontier</h2>
<i>"Evil King's guardians were strong"<br>
--Sunder</i>
<p>You come closer to the frontier of Evil King's kingdom and see here strong guardians, with alot of money and good defending and attacking skills. You ask them to give you a way, but they laughed at you. So now you must fight! Thanks to furies, you choose to help your friend Munder, and now general Klod Jandor helping you. Good luck!
$Button=Its too hard for me!,Tell,Campaign
$Button=Play!,DoNothing,0

[@1]

<h2>~lIncoming Message</h2>
<i>~jFrom: ~qGeneral Klod Jandor<br>
~jTo: ~qSunder</i>
<p>Hi man! Let's kill those mighty guardians!

$Button=Accept,DoNothing,0
$Button=Check your Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55

[Succeeded] [BadTeamDead]

<h2>~lCongratulations!</h2>
<i>"He laughed on me... and now he is dead!"<br>
--Sunder</i>
<p>You beat the Guardian of the Frontier! You send great thanks to the general Klod Jandor, without his help tis will be impossible. Now you going to capture the residence of Evil King.

